        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 3910P-US32D, Contemporary Passage Sliding Pocket Door Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA complete set, the Round Stainless Steel Passage Pocket Door Sett comes with 2 round sliding pocket door cup pulls and a matching fingertip edge pull. It is made out of stainless steel with a brushed stainless steel finish. For use on pocket doors, sliding doors, sliding barn doors, or cabinet doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe finger edge pull is pressure mounted into the door's edge so that you have something to grip in order to slide the door out of the pocket. The round flush pulls are pressure mounted into the door's face. No screws are needed for a clean, contemporary appearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/round-stainless-steel-privacy-pocket-door-mortise-lock-omnia-3910-us32d\"><b>Round Privacy Pocket Door Lock</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/french-sliding-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-3910dd-us32d\"><b>Round Double Pocket Door Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 3910P Round Pocket Door Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>.050\" Thick Solid Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Depth: 1-19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) round flush pulls and a round edge pull. For One (1) Door.\r\n</p>",
